+	speech_tutorial2_k2_Subtitle_Text_13 = "Now you should have a basic Swordsman company.  You can increase the strength of this company by adding Flank and Support units to its other positions.  Go ahead and click a Halberdier for the flank position and a Warmage for the support.  You will notice that the flank position is locked as pairs, similar to the front line being locked as groups of four."
